      "w": 650,
      "h": 134,
      "title": "ODH component image builds",
      "lines": [
        "EvalHub stable → quay.io/opendatahub/odh-eval-hub",
        "Workload stable + module main → opendatahub operator images",
        "Tag: odh-stable; Konflux build / scan tasks (policy: Q4–Q5)"
      ],
      "kind": "build",
      "detail": "Stable EvalHub and TrustyAI workload PipelineRuns resolve odh-konflux-central pipeline/multi-arch-container-build.yaml. Module PipelineRuns target main and publish odh-trustyai-module-operator:odh-stable. Central scan task presence does not prove all findings block selection. Community quay.io/evalhub/evalhub is a parallel upstream output, not the RHOAI container being promoted.",
