      "id": "rh-freeze",
      "x": 815,
      "y": 925,
      "w": 650,
      "h": 108,
      "title": "G9 · Merge / backport into the release branch",
      "lines": [
        "Branch-specific tests + approvals; freeze exceptions when enabled",
        "EA gatekeeper configured for 3.6-ea.1 / 3.6-ea.2"
      ],
      "kind": "gate",
      "detail": "Push builds run after code reaches the release branch. The inspected main gatekeeper definition calls shared post-codefreeze logic for two EA branches; confirm its deployed status, required label/approval policy, and branch coverage. Do not assume the EA gate applies to every development branch.",
      "sources": [
        "rh-freeze",
        "rh-eval-build",
        "rh-workload-build"
